# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Faith Gerald Online Services — repository ignores
#
# Plain static HTML/CSS/JS. No build step, no dependencies, so this file is
# deliberately short. Everything the site needs to run is committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Design source material -------------------------------------------------
# The supplied reference poster and the original landing export. These are
# inputs that produced assets/hero/hero-device.jpg and assets/brand/*, not
# files the site loads. Kept on disk, out of the repo.
design/

# --- Impeccable tooling state -----------------------------------------------
# Session and hook state only. PRODUCT.md and DESIGN.md ARE committed: they
# are real project documentation, not session state.
.impeccable/
.impeccable-live.json
.impeccable-live/

# --- Local dev servers ------------------------------------------------------
# The static preview server and any local tooling output.
tools/*.local.*
*.local.json
*.local.css
*.local.js

# --- Editor / OS noise ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Logs and temp files ----------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.tmp
*.temp
